- Volta-2 error E34: Error E34 on a Volta-2 means battery communication was lost: reseat the CAN cable.
- Volta-2 error E21: Error E21 on a Volta-2 means the grid voltage is out of range: check the AC isolator.

ACTION reply {"message": "Error E57 on your Volta-X indicates a fan fault. To fix it: clear the intake grille of any dust or debris, then restart the inverter. If the error persists after that, let us know and we'll arrange further assistance."}
